Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant tables / columns and their usage
• DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS  
  – "Icd10Code": join to ICD10CODE to decide whether the record is a “discharge”‑ or “vehicle”‑related death  
  – "RaceRecode3": filter to code = 1 (“White”)  
  – "AgeRecode27", "AgeRecode52", "AgeRecode12": alternative columns that hold the decedent’s age‑group – choose one for aggregation  
• DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE  
  – "Code": join key to DEATHRECORDS."Icd10Code"  
  – "Description": look for %discharge% or %vehicle% (exclude “Urethral discharge”, “Discharge of firework”, “Legal intervention involving firearm discharge”)  
• DEATH.DEATH.RACERECODE3  
  – "Code", "Description": mapping table showing that code 1 = White (condition: DEATHRECORDS."RaceRecode3" = 1)  
• DEATH.DEATH.AGERECODE27 (or 12 / 52)  
  – "Code": join key to DEATHRECORDS."AgeRecode27"  
  – "Description": human‑readable age‑group label  

Typical filter / join conditions you will need  
• WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1                                 -- White only  
• icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'  
      AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%urethral%discharge%'  
      AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firework%'  
      AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firearm%discharge%'  
• icd."Description" ILIKE '%vehicle%'  

Exploratory Snowflake queries  
```sql
--1. Description: List all ICD‑10 codes containing the word “discharge”
SELECT DISTINCT icd."Code", icd."Description"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
WHERE icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--2. Description: Show “discharge” codes after excluding the three unwanted phrases
SELECT DISTINCT icd."Code", icd."Description"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
WHERE icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%urethral%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firework%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firearm%discharge%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--3. Description: List ICD‑10 codes whose descriptions contain the word “vehicle”
SELECT DISTINCT icd."Code", icd."Description"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
WHERE icd."Description" ILIKE '%vehicle%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--4. Description: Verify race‑recode mapping (show the row for White)
SELECT "Code", "Description"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.RACERECODE3
WHERE "Description" = 'White'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--5. Description: Preview age‑group labels in AGERECODE27
SELECT "Code", "Description"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.AGERECODE27
ORDER BY "Code"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--6. Description: Pick 20 White decedents and show ICD‑10 code & age‑group
SELECT dr."Id", dr."Icd10Code", dr."AgeRecode27", dr."RaceRecode3"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--7. Description: Count deaths among Whites whose ICD‑10 description contains “discharge” (after exclusions)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS "death_cnt"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
JOIN DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
  ON dr."Icd10Code" = icd."Code"
WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
  AND icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%urethral%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firework%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firearm%discharge%';
```

```sql
--8. Description: Count deaths among Whites whose ICD‑10 description contains “vehicle”
SELECT COUNT(*) AS "death_cnt"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
JOIN DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
  ON dr."Icd10Code" = icd."Code"
WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
  AND icd."Description" ILIKE '%vehicle%';
```

```sql
--9. Description: Aggregate by age group – discharge‑related deaths (White only)
SELECT dr."AgeRecode27"      AS "age_code",
       COUNT(*)              AS "discharge_deaths"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
JOIN DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
  ON dr."Icd10Code" = icd."Code"
WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
  AND icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%urethral%discharge%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firework%'
  AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firearm%discharge%'
GROUP BY dr."AgeRecode27"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. Description: Combine discharge‑ and vehicle‑related counts, compute averages per age group
SELECT ar."Description"                    AS "age_group",
       AVG(dis."death_cnt")                AS "avg_discharge_deaths",
       AVG(veh."death_cnt")                AS "avg_vehicle_deaths",
       AVG(dis."death_cnt") - AVG(veh."death_cnt") AS "avg_difference"
FROM DEATH.DEATH.AGERECODE27 ar
LEFT JOIN (
     SELECT dr."AgeRecode27", COUNT(*) AS "death_cnt"
     FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
     JOIN DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
       ON dr."Icd10Code" = icd."Code"
     WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
       AND icd."Description" ILIKE '%discharge%'
       AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%urethral%discharge%'
       AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firework%'
       AND icd."Description" NOT ILIKE '%firearm%discharge%'
     GROUP BY dr."AgeRecode27"
) dis
  ON ar."Code" = dis."AgeRecode27"
LEFT JOIN (
     SELECT dr."AgeRecode27", COUNT(*) AS "death_cnt"
     FROM DEATH.DEATH.DEATHRECORDS dr
     JOIN DEATH.DEATH.ICD10CODE icd
       ON dr."Icd10Code" = icd."Code"
     WHERE dr."RaceRecode3" = 1
       AND icd."Description" ILIKE '%vehicle%'
     GROUP BY dr."AgeRecode27"
) veh
  ON ar."Code" = veh."AgeRecode27"
GROUP BY ar."Description"
ORDER BY ar."Description"
LIMIT 20;
```
